# The tempo/ folder is Tempo's local canvas dev host, not part of the deployed
# site. The design canvases under tempo/designs are committed on purpose so the
# work is versioned, but nothing in here should reach a production build:
#
#   - tempo/app/tempo-host/page.tsx imports tempo/.tempo/tempo-host, which is
#     generated locally and gitignored, so it is missing on Vercel.
#   - tempo/public is a symlink to ../public, which build-time file tracing
#     should not have to follow.
#
# tsconfig.json also excludes "tempo" so local `next build` stays clean.
tempo
